'''Kafauco''' ({{langx|kz|ߞߊߝߙߊߥߎߞߏ|Kàfáùkò}}), formerly '''Kafto-Araucarian Petroleum Company'''), officially the '''Sanyanian Oil Company''', is a majority state-owned [[W:Petroleum|petroleum]] and [[W:Natural gas|natural gas]] company that is the [[W:National oil company|national oil company]] of [[Sanyan]]. {{As of|2024}}, it is the second-[[List of largest companies in Kaftia by revenue|largest company in Kaftia by revenue]] after [[Burawa]]'s [[Burawa Oil|state oil company]]. 

